# Stochastic Nonconvex Variance-Reduced Conditional Gradient

PHASE0 STATUS (iteration 54): the source-facing Algorithm 7.13 and Theorem 7.17
objects are modeled over the general input schedule `α : ℕ → ℝ`, source epoch
length `T_alg`, and source batch size `b_alg`. The fixed Eq. (7.4.15) schedule is
