facts are required. Remaining public declarations that consume
`Algorithm713OutputLawWellDefined`, `Theorem716DomainBoundary`,
`Theorem716LiteralCoordinateBridge`, or `Algorithm713RealizationContract` are
boundary-only, internal-helper, corrected, or extension-only declarations by
