  Book/PDF citation: source_json `key_lemmas[2].ref` quotes `Theorem 7.16`;
  PDF Algorithm 7.12 says `Generate i.i.d. samples I_b of size b according to
  Q`. -/
  hsample_meas : ∀ k : ℕ, Measurable (sample k)
  /-- Probability measure for algorithmic sampling. -/
