    (setup.algorithmInnerAlphaWindow_nonempty h)
    (fun j => setup.α (setup.algorithmGlobalIndex s j))

/-- Active within-epoch steps actually generated by Algorithm 7.13.

This is the source-faithful partial-final-epoch window for the variable schedule
