/-- The state available before the `k`-th recursive mini-batch is measurable
with respect to the filtration cutoff that stops just before that batch begins.
This is the adaptedness fact unlocked by the actual flattened sample layout:
refresh samples live in the prefix of length `N * m`, so refresh indices
`r * m + i` stay below the recursive cutoff once the generated run is restricted
to the finite `N`-step horizon; earlier recursive indices are below it by
